# The image is assembled from a staged context (ADR-0068 §2), so the context
# is the staged directory and nothing else. Everything is excluded and
# dist/image is admitted back, which keeps a source tree, a node_modules and
# a .git out of every build and makes a missing staged file fail loudly
# instead of resolving to something stale.
*
!dist/image
!dist/image/**
